row          got            want           note                                                     
enc ok       yes            yes            ALL EIGHT planted words match the decoder's own mask -- checked before any run ok
live         0x2a           0x2a           LIVENESS: a plain `mov r0,#0x2a' plants, steps and prints ok
pc adv       0x8004         0x8004         CONTROL: pc advanced exactly 4 -- see the header on what an untranslatable word does ok
mid          0xde           0xde           UBFX #4,#8 of 0x89abcdef -- only a correct encoding AND execution gives 0xde ok
